# A fillet's edges changed on its screen (ROADMAP F7): two top edges of
# the extrusion of path_extrude rounded, as in ext_fillet; [remove] on
# the second edge's row leaves the first alone; [change] with nothing
# selected activates the extrusion, whose edges the fillet rounds, and
# says what to select; with the second edge picked, [change] rounds it
# instead. Check Solid finds each sound.
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
click-entity 80030004
click-entity 8003001f
menu Features|Fillet Edges
tw
twmove 492 205
twdown L 492 205
twup L 492 205
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
answer ok
twmove 96 145
twdown L 96 145
twup L 96 145
click-entity 8003001f
twmove 96 145
twdown L 96 145
twup L 96 145
tw
